    "Leaving keeps everything you wrote. Your publications and articles stay in your repository, and your name and account are untouched. What goes is your membership and the pages Nook publishes for you, and coming back needs a new invitation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leaving keeps everything you wrote. Your publications and articles stay in your repository, and your name and account are untouched. What goes is your membership and the pages Nook publishes for you, and coming back needs a new invitation."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退会しても書いたものはすべて残ります。発行物と記事はリポジトリにそのまま残り、名前とアカウントにも触れません。なくなるのはメンバーシップと Nook が公開していたページで、再開には新しい招待が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "탈퇴해도 쓴 글은 모두 남습니다. 발행물과 글은 내 저장소에 그대로 있고, 이름과 계정도 건드리지 않습니다. 사라지는 것은 멤버십과 Nook이 발행해 주던 페이지이며, 다시 시작하려면 새 초대가 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退出会保留你写下的一切。出版物和文章仍留在你的仓库中，你的名称和账户不受影响。消失的是会员身份和 Nook 为你发布的页面，重新加入需要新的邀请。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
